OL,3,GNEWSADisorder charge dropped over
OL,4,Anightclub evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused with disorderly behaviour
OL,7,Ffollowing an incident which saw a
OL,8,FGuernsey nightclub evacuated has had
OL,9,Fthe charge against him dropped.
OL,11,FFrancesco Biancu, 33, was charged with
OL,12,Fbehaving in a disorderly manner after
OL,13,Fan incident at Les Folies d'Amour in St
OL,14,FPeter Port that led to the club being
OL,15,Fevacuated on 9 May.
OL,17,FHe was initially charged with making
OL,18,Fbomb hoaxes, but this was amended to
OL,19,Fthe disorderly charge, which he pleaded
OL,20,Fnot guilty to.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
